{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27039","headline":"杨给事师臯哭亡爱姬英英窃闻诗人多赋因而继和 · 姚合","name":"杨给事师臯哭亡爱姬英英窃闻诗人多赋因而继和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"真珠爲土玉爲尘，未识遥闻鼻亦辛。\n天上还应收至宝，世间难得是佳人。\n朱丝自断虚银烛，红粉潜销冷绣裀。\n见说忘情唯有酒，夕阳对酒更伤神。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27039.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27039","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}